@startuml
actor Cliente
participant "Interfaz web" as Web
participant "API HTTP" as API
participant MarketplaceService as Service
participant OfferRepository as Repo
database "PostgreSQL administrado" as DB
queue "Cola durable" as Queue
Cliente -> Web: Selecciona pack y confirma reserva
Web -> API: POST /api/reservations
API -> Service: reserveOffer(offerId, quantity)
Service -> Repo: reserveIfAvailable(id, quantity)
Repo -> DB: Transacción: verificar y descontar stock
DB --> Repo: Reserva e inventario confirmados
Repo --> Service: Reserva creada
Service -> Queue: ReservationCreated
Service --> API: reserva + total
API --> Web: HTTP 201
Web --> Cliente: Muestra código y ventana de recogida
Queue -> Queue: Consumidor notifica al comercio
@enduml
